Comments between :CLASS and :INHERIT are transparent: diag.inherit_position
must stay silent. Should be clean.
-- input.ssl --
/* Widget base wiring;
:CLASS Slider;
/* The parent supplies Init and Render;
:INHERIT Lab.Control;
:DECLARE nValue;

:PROCEDURE Init;
	Base:Init();
	Me:nValue := 0;
:ENDPROC;
